MODULE: RedirectInstalledOnCompletionRevertKeepsOldRedirect
TARGET: RedirectInstalledOnCompletion
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: revert returns without clearing the previous redirect and arming the shadow
PERTURBS: RevertRedirect

--- FIND
    /\ redirect' = [redirect EXCEPT ![source] = "none", !["restored"] = source]
--- REPLACE
    /\ redirect' = redirect
--- END
